<title>AUSTRIA: Boehler 9-mo net profit down 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Boehler 9-mo net profit down 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian high-grade steelmaker Boehler-Uddeholm said on Tuesday net profit in the first nine months of the year fell 22 percent to 632 million schillings ($59.8 million) and that pretax profit fell eight percent.</p>
<p>Boehler said in a statement it still aimed to post a flat pretax profit for the full year. ($ = 10.57 Austrian Schillings)</p>
